    "prompt": "In this image, all directions are relative to the frame. A photo of a person wearing a hat next to a refrigerator with a rock on top. Every banana is yellow and inside the refrigerator.",
    "dsl": "(and (IsStyle 'photo') (exists ?p (exists ?h (exists ?r (and (Is ?p 'person') (Is ?h 'hat') (Is ?r 'refrigerator') (On ?h ?p) (NextTo ?p ?r) (forall ?b (implies (Is ?b 'banana') (and (In ?b ?r) (HasColor ?b 'yellow')))) (exists ?rk (and (Is ?rk 'rock') (On ?rk ?r))))))))",
